# Spanish-synopsis translation working files (regenerated from DB + work log)
data/localization/_pending-es.jsonl
data/localization/_batches/
data/localization/_export.err

# Local design-system import drop (Claude Design zips / extracted .dc.html)
.design-import/

# next dev auto-generates these per-app agent files
apps/web/AGENTS.md
apps/web/CLAUDE.md

# Screenshots written by the Playwright suites on every run (kept locally, not versioned).
e2e/artifacts/

# Assistant tooling (GSD installs, hooks, local settings and instruction files) stays on the
